      307.2,
      384.32,
      547.36,
      502.4
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Matara Divisional Secretariat on the 27th April, 2018 at10.30 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing(in duplicate) on or before the 20th of April the nature of theirinterests in the land, the particulars of their claims forcompensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude,the amount of compensation and the details of thecompensation of such amount.",
